# ============================================================
#  tokenizer-vitis — MicroBlaze firmware (Vitis 2025.2)
# ============================================================
# Only source is tracked: the app (lwip_echo_server/src), the BSP driver
# sources + PHY patches, the platform config, and the exported hardware (.xsa).
# The compiled BSP, bitstreams, and CMake/Ninja build trees are regenerated
# by the Vitis "Build" action and are intentionally NOT tracked.

# ---- Build trees ----
/build
/export
**/build_configs/gen_bsp/
**/bsp/lib/
**/.cache/
**/.Xil/

# ---- Compiled artifacts ----
*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.a
*.elf
*.bit
*.mmi
*.pdi
*.bin
*.lo
*.so

# ---- CMake / Ninja build state ----
**/CMakeFiles/
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/*.ninja
**/.ninja_deps
**/.ninja_log
**/CMakeOutput.log
**/CMakeError.log

# ---- IDE session state ----
_ide/logs
_ide/.wsdata
_ide/version.ini
_ide/workspace_journal*.py
**/_ide/bitstream/
.vitisWorkspace.json

# ---- Logs / locks / OS junk ----
/logs
*.log
*.lock
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
